#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "before_asking_question"
msgid "Before you ask a question, please first read the"
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_1_title_commons"
msgid "How come I don't see this apps widget on the list of widgets?"
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_1_text_commons"
msgid ""
"It is most likely because you moved the app on an SD card. There is an "
"Android system limitation which hides the given app widgets in that case. "
"The only solution is to move the app back onto the Internal Storage via your "
"device settings."
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_2_title_commons"
msgid ""
"I want to support you, but I cannot donate money. Is there anything else I "
"can do?"
msgstr ""

#, auto-safe-html, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_2_text_commons"
msgid ""
"<![CDATA[\n"
"            Yes, of course. You can spread the word about the apps or give "
"good feedback and ratings. You can also help by translating the apps in a "
"new language, or just update some existing translations.\n"
"            The guide to translating is at <a href=\"https://github.com/"
"FossifyOrg/General-Discussion#how-can-i-suggest-an-edit-to-a-file\">this "
"website</a>, or just contact us at <a href=\"mailto:hello@fossify.org\">"
"hello@fossify.org</a> if you have any questions.\n"
"        ]]>"
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_3_title_commons"
msgid "I deleted some files by mistake, how can I recover them?"
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_3_text_commons"
msgid ""
"Sadly, you cannot. Files are deleted instantly after the confirmation "
"dialog, there is no trashbin available."
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_4_title_commons"
msgid "I don't like the widget colors, can I change them?"
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_4_text_commons"
msgid ""
"Yep, as you drag a widget on your home screen a widget config screen "
"appears. You will see colored squares at the bottom left corner, just press "
"them to pick a new color. You can use the slider for adjusting the alpha too."
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_5_title_commons"
msgid "Can I somehow restore deleted files?"
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_5_text_commons"
msgid ""
"If they were really deleted, you cannot recover them. However, the recycle "
"bin is enabled by default and moves files into the bin instead of deleting "
"them immediately."
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_6_title_commons"
msgid "The app launcher icon disappeared. What can I do?"
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_6_text_commons"
msgid ""
"This issue arises when your launcher does not fully support icon "
"customization. Attempt launching the app through Google Play or a widget, if "
"accessible. After launching, restore the default green icon color #106D1F. "
"In extreme cases, reinstalling the app may be necessary."
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_7_title_commons"
msgid ""
"The money has been deducted from my bank account, but I cannot download the "
"app. What can I do?"
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_7_text_commons"
msgid ""
"Payments are fully handled by Google, their system glitches from time to "
"time. Just clear your Google Play app cache and restart your device, then "
"retry downloading it."
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_8_title_commons"
msgid "Why should I upgrade to the Pro version?"
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_8_text_commons"
msgid ""
"As your app version is no longer updated, the bugs you have maybe spotted "
"will never be fixed. There will also be no new functions added. You can "
"purchase the Pro version on Google Play for a small sum of money. It is a "
"one time payment, which means that once you purchase it, you will never have "
"to pay again. Not even after getting a new device. If you won't like the Pro "
"version, you can just uninstall it within a few hours and you will "
"automatically get your money back. If you want a refund anytime later, just "
"contact us at hello@fossify.org and you will get it."
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_9_title_commons"
msgid "How can I select multiple items at once?"
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_9_text_commons"
msgid ""
"There are multiple ways of doing that. The first one is starting the "
"selection mode by long pressing one item, then short clicking on others to "
"select them. The second way is similar to selecting items on PCs with a "
"mouse, just start the selection mode by long pressing one item, then with "
"your finger still down drag it across other items for selecting. The third "
"way of selecting multiple items is long pressing one item, then long "
"pressing another one and everything in between gets selected. If you want to "
"select all items, just long press one item, then click at the selected item "
"counter at the top left corner. That will select or unselect all everything."
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_10_title_commons"
msgid "I have purchased the app, but I cannot download it on another device."
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_10_text_commons"
msgid ""
"Try clearing your Google Play app cache and restarting your device. It is "
"some Google Play glitch, not really related to the app itself."
msgstr ""

